  "version": "@PROJECT_VERSION@",
  "author": "DarkZant",
  "description": "Customize the capacities of Wallets, Bomb Bags, Quivers and Slingshot Pellets. Leaving the default value does not override other settings/mods (example: Bigger Wallets setting). Changing capacities instantly updates your item amounts, so be careful with lower capacities causing you to lose items.",
